# Nothing but the gateway sources belongs in the build context. In particular
# no .env, no test fixtures and no CVs.
#
# Allow-list, not a deny-list: a new secret dropped in this directory is
# excluded by default rather than shipped by default. The cost is that every
# new runtime file must be added here — the build fails loudly when one is
# missing, which is the correct direction to fail.
*

# --- runtime ---
!gateway.py
!docling_sidecar.py
!resource_probe.py
!entrypoint.sh

# --- build-time provisioning and verification ---
!requirements.txt
!compat_check.py
!ocr-assets.lock
!fetch-ocr-assets.sh
!ocr-models.lock
!warm_ocr_assets.py

# --- Stage 2 benchmark tooling ---
# Run 2 executes inside the pod, so these must ship. They are inert on the
# request path: nothing in the gateway imports them.
!stage2_benchmark.py
!generate_fixtures.py
!test_ocr_gate.py

# Deliberately NOT copied: check-pins.sh, lock.sh, versions.env. Those are CI
# tooling and every extra file in a document-parsing image is surface.
